<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>博客设置 on Aliya の 笔记</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/categories/%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE/</link><description>Recent content in 博客设置 on Aliya の 笔记</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><atom:link href="https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/categories/%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>博客封面格式升级实录：JPEG → WebP → AVIF</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95jpeg-webp-avif/</link><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 15:27:26 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95jpeg-webp-avif/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-148.avif" alt="Featured image of post 博客封面格式升级实录：JPEG → WebP → AVIF" />全站 73 张封面从 JPEG 换到 AVIF(q60)：40.1MB → 11.4MB，省 72%，画质 PSNR 反而更高。这篇把判断依据、转换脚本思路、上传与缓存坑、验证与回退全部写下来，照着能复刻</description></item><item><title>Hugo 博客优化实录：瘦掉 221MB 死图与几个小坑</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/hugo-%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95%E7%98%A6%E6%8E%89-221mb-%E6%AD%BB%E5%9B%BE%E4%B8%8E%E5%87%A0%E4%B8%AA%E5%B0%8F%E5%9D%91/</link><pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 18:03:27 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/hugo-%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95%E7%98%A6%E6%8E%89-221mb-%E6%AD%BB%E5%9B%BE%E4%B8%8E%E5%87%A0%E4%B8%AA%E5%B0%8F%E5%9D%91/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-116.avif" alt="Featured image of post Hugo 博客优化实录：瘦掉 221MB 死图与几个小坑" />博客跑得好好的，一查才发现仓库里躺着 221MB 没人用的封面原图、robots.txt 竟然是 404、语言码还对不上。这篇记录一次 Hugo 博客体检与优化的全过程，附踩过的坑。</description></item><item><title>博客自定义样式</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E6%A0%B7%E5%BC%8F/</link><pubDate>Sun, 29 Dec 2024 17:24:18 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E6%A0%B7%E5%BC%8F/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-144.avif" alt="Featured image of post 博客自定义样式" />小tips……😋</description></item><item><title>添加 Turbolinks 支持</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0-turbolinks-%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81/</link><pubDate>Thu, 26 Dec 2024 19:41:40 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0-turbolinks-%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-082.avif" alt="Featured image of post 添加 Turbolinks 支持" />小tips……😋</description></item><item><title>默认文章YAML Front Matter</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%E6%96%87%E7%AB%A0yaml-front-matter/</link><pubDate>Mon, 16 Dec 2024 09:53:39 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%E6%96%87%E7%AB%A0yaml-front-matter/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-023.avif" alt="Featured image of post 默认文章YAML Front Matter" />小tips……😋</description></item><item><title>校正构建时覆盖文件的最后的修改时间</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E6%A0%A1%E6%AD%A3%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BA%E6%97%B6%E8%A6%86%E7%9B%96%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4/</link><pubDate>Sun, 15 Dec 2024 23:38:14 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E6%A0%A1%E6%AD%A3%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BA%E6%97%B6%E8%A6%86%E7%9B%96%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-017.avif" alt="Featured image of post 校正构建时覆盖文件的最后的修改时间" />在构建之前重新恢复文件在本地系统的修改时间，避免被commit时间覆盖导致显示错误 GitHub Actions 自动部署 Hugo 博客说明文档 本文档详细说明了 .github/workflows/main.yml 文件的配置和工</description></item><item><title>HUGO搭建使用注意</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/hugo%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F/</link><pubDate>Sun, 15 Dec 2024 03:56:11 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/hugo%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://img.meituan.net/video/1254de0c71736e5846e8239eeb395bb11420405.jpg" alt="Featured image of post HUGO搭建使用注意" />1、源代码仓库hugo，静态资源仓库public 2、public不能上传到hugo仓库，否则构建出错 3、token一定要有workflow和</description></item><item><title>hugo-magic 写作短代码(三) —— 改</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/3/</link><pubDate>Sun, 16 Jun 2024 04:43:15 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/3/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-014.avif" alt="Featured image of post hugo-magic 写作短代码(三) —— 改" />hugo.yaml 几乎所有自定义都在根目录 hugo.yaml 文件中去修改 AI 摘要 AI 摘要脚本 sm.py 在根目录下,不要移动到其他地方,需要安装 python,然后运行 python sm.py 输入slug: slug</description></item><item><title>hugo博客写作流程(二) —— 改</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/2/</link><pubDate>Sat, 15 Jun 2024 23:09:57 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/2/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-005.avif" alt="Featured image of post hugo博客写作流程(二) —— 改" />写作工具 推荐两款软件,本人都使用过: typora 和 obsidian typora 破解版: https://github.com/woniu336/typora-007 新建文章 在博客目录找到shell/quickstart.sh双击打开即可 先设置全局代理</description></item><item><title>hugo-magic主题使用教程(一) —— 改</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/1/</link><pubDate>Sat, 15 Jun 2024 21:22:11 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/1/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-001.avif" alt="Featured image of post hugo-magic主题使用教程(一) —— 改" />前提条件 以下教程以 windows10 为例 操作终端使用 git bash 魔法上网的前提下 下载 hugo https://github.com/gohugoio/hugo/releases/download/v0.127.0/hugo_extended_0.127.0_windows-amd64.zip 解压到任意目录,然后将目录添加到系统环境变量 如图 (windows) 打开 cmd 输入 hugo version 验证是否设置</description></item></channel></rss>